{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33813","headline":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 叉鱼 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 叉鱼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"列炬春溪口，平潭如不流。\n照见游泳鱼，一一如清昼。\n中目碎琼碧，毁鳞殷组绣。\n乐此何太荒，居然媿川后。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}